  <History Date="12-02-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (removes first gobo slot and renames accordingly, adds fan theatre and autofocus control functions/macros for 29 channel mode.  changes all modes to use the same prism rot functions)" Version="5" />
